    </span>\n    </span>\n   </li>\n  </ol>\n  <div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\">\n   <h2 id=\"參見\">\n    <span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.A6.8B\">\n    </span>\n    參見\n   </h2>\n   <span class=\"mw-editsection\">\n    <span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">\n     [\n    </span>\n    <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%99%9B%E6%93%AC%E5%9C%B0%E7%90%83&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"编辑章节：參見\">\n     <span>\n      编辑\n     </span>\n    </a>\n    <span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">\n     ]\n    </span>\n   </span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Google_%E5%9C%B0%E7%90%83\" title=\"Google 地球\">\n     Google 地球\n    </a>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/NASA_World_Wind\" title=\"NASA World Wind\">\n     NASA World Wind\n    </a>\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.codfw.main‐59b49899b4‐qcrbm\nCached time: 20260619143615\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Citation/CS1 (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update]\nCPU time usage: 0.166 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.212 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 273/1000000\nRevision size: 1893/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 11584/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 102/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 10661/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.106/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 2117644/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n  <!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  163.782      1 -total\n 55.35%   90.660      1 Template:Refimprove\n 52.22%   85.528      1 Template:Ambox\n 39.95%   65.423      1 Template:Cite_journal\n  2.78%    4.559      1 Template:Cite_web\n  1.92%    3.145      1 Template:Template_error\n  1.16%    1.893      1 Template:Template_error/core\n-->\n  <!-- Render ID 39b7dd9a-6bec